WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.592
"Hurry!" the princess cried to the children.

2
00:00:13.593 --> 00:00:15.998
"I have been gone too long!

3
00:00:15.999 --> 00:00:19.922
By now the servants will be looking for me!"

4
00:00:19.923 --> 00:00:26.302
When they reached a courtyard, several servants rushed toward the princess.

5
00:00:26.303 --> 00:00:30.630
"Where have you been, Your Highness?" cried one woman.

6
00:00:30.631 --> 00:00:34.708
"Your Highness!" Another servant gasped.

7
00:00:34.709 --> 00:00:37.146
"Who are these strangers?

8
00:00:37.147 --> 00:00:39.426
Did they kidnap you?"

9
00:00:39.427 --> 00:00:44.578
"No, they did not kidnap me!" the princess replied.

10
00:00:44.579 --> 00:00:47.609
"They helped me," she added.

11
00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:50.704
"And now they are my honored guests."

12
00:00:50.705 --> 00:00:54.650
The servants did not look happy to hear this.

13
00:00:54.651 --> 00:00:59.168
But they bowed quietly and then stepped aside.

14
00:00:59.169 --> 00:01:03.839
The children followed the princess into a small building.

15
00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:08.305
She invited them to sit around a low table.

16
00:01:08.306 --> 00:01:13.179
Then she left for a moment to change her clothing.

17
00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:17.737
Mandy noticed a sheet of paper with unusual writing.

18
00:01:17.738 --> 00:01:20.788
"Are these Chinese characters?"

19
00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:23.829
she asked when the princess returned.

20
00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:27.086
"No," said the princess.

21
00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:31.820
"That is hangul, the alphabet that my father invented."

22
00:01:31.821 --> 00:01:36.641
"Your father invented an alphabet?" said Mandy.

23
00:01:36.642 --> 00:01:39.766
"Yes," said the princess.

24
00:01:39.767 --> 00:01:43.267
"Our people have always spoken in Korean.

25
00:01:43.268 --> 00:01:47.368
But they used Chinese characters to read and write.

26
00:01:47.369 --> 00:01:51.245
Chinese characters were very difficult to learn.

27
00:01:51.246 --> 00:01:55.498
And only nobles could go to school to learn them."

28
00:01:55.499 --> 00:01:59.021
"That's not fair!" Mandy said.

29
00:01:59.022 --> 00:02:02.319
"I agree," said the princess.

30
00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:05.591
"My father didn't think it was fair either.

31
00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:10.834
That is why he worked with scholars to invent a simple alphabet.

32
00:02:10.835 --> 00:02:13.804
Hangul is very easy to learn.

33
00:02:13.805 --> 00:02:17.509
And now the Korean people have their own alphabet."

34
00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:23.083
"It sounds like your father was a great king," said Mandy.

35
00:02:23.084 --> 00:02:29.403
"He was. And he loved his people very much," replied the princess.

36
00:02:29.404 --> 00:02:32.833
"But hangul has not spread to everyone yet.

37
00:02:32.834 --> 00:02:35.913
Some people are upset by hangul.

38
00:02:35.914 --> 00:02:40.592
They say that learning is only for nobles and royalty."

39
00:02:40.593 --> 00:02:44.833
The princess pulled out a clean sheet of paper.

40
00:02:44.834 --> 00:02:49.402
"Now I will show you just how beautiful hangul is!"

41
00:02:49.403 --> 00:02:53.807
The princess poured water into the inkstone.

42
00:02:53.808 --> 00:03:01.140
Then she made ink, dipped a brush into it, and wrote two hangul letters.

43
00:03:01.141 --> 00:03:02.426
"Here you are."

44
00:03:02.427 --> 00:03:05.084
She gave the paper to Vinnie.

45
00:03:05.085 --> 00:03:07.536
"This says Vi-nnie.

46
00:03:07.537 --> 00:03:09.284
For your name!"

47
00:03:09.285 --> 00:03:12.278
"Thank you!" said Vinnie.

48
00:03:12.279 --> 00:03:18.484
Next the princess wrote Mandy's and Gildong's names in hangul too.

49
00:03:18.485 --> 00:03:22.066
Gildong was very pleased by the gift.

50
00:03:22.067 --> 00:03:24.037
"Thank you, Princess.

51
00:03:24.038 --> 00:03:26.174
I will remember this.

52
00:03:26.175 --> 00:03:29.202
I hope I get to learn hangul soon."

53
00:03:29.203 --> 00:03:34.298
"I think you will, Gildong," she said with a smile.

54
00:03:34.299 --> 00:03:37.846
Just then there was a sound at the door.

55
00:03:37.847 --> 00:03:41.202
A servant spoke in a worried voice.

56
00:03:41.203 --> 00:03:45.159
"Your Highness! The guards are coming!

57
00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:52.015
And they are looking for your friends!"
